    "body": "## Summary\n- add authenticated `/blocked-users` management for the caller's private block list\n- add block/unblock controls to job conversations using the existing server-side user-block API\n- disable the local composer immediately after the caller blocks the counterpart while preserving chat history\n- keep reverse-block state private; the UI hydrates only blocks created by the current user\n- document web behavior and server-side enforcement boundaries\n\n## Safety / privacy\n- the client never receives or infers whether the other participant blocked the caller\n- exact location, route, live tracking, escrow, payment and moderation data are not added to the blocking surface\n- backend symmetric block enforcement remains the source of truth before persistence, notification and WebSocket delivery\n- blocking does not mutate job lifecycle or escrow state\n\n## Validation\nRun frontend lint/build plus the existing API/runtime workflows. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
